WEBVTT

00:38.663 --> 00:40.540
FIRST PLACE
REGULAR PROMOTION TEST AWARD

00:40.623 --> 00:42.167
Having fun is important to me.

00:42.792 --> 00:44.878
Doing something fun makes me happy.

00:45.962 --> 00:47.922
Happy people are healthy people,

00:48.882 --> 00:49.716
which is why,

00:50.884 --> 00:53.887
for the sake of my health and happiness,
I only do fun stuff.

00:56.556 --> 01:00.518
And there's nothing I love more
than sports and e-sports.

01:01.895 --> 01:02.729
Do you know why?

01:04.689 --> 01:06.232
Because I always win.

01:28.546 --> 01:29.380
The head!

01:42.310 --> 01:43.770
The head!

01:55.406 --> 01:56.241
Break!

01:56.324 --> 01:57.283
Red wins!

01:57.909 --> 01:58.910
Are you okay?

01:59.786 --> 02:00.829
Great match.

02:00.912 --> 02:02.122
Sure.

02:06.793 --> 02:10.547
Enemy entering the compound.
One down. Another one down.

02:13.091 --> 02:14.676
I'm down. Back me up quickly.

02:14.759 --> 02:18.346
Hey! They're using smoke and moving in.
We can't keep them out.

02:18.429 --> 02:19.973
-I'm down.
-I see one moving in.

02:20.056 --> 02:23.143
-I'll throw a grenade. Fall back.
-Okay, I'm heading to the stairs.

02:24.435 --> 02:25.937
Damn, I'm down.

02:26.020 --> 02:27.272
They're closing in on you!

02:27.355 --> 02:28.731
You're all dead meat.

02:28.815 --> 02:31.151
Go, Diarrhea.

02:31.985 --> 02:32.819
One down.

02:33.695 --> 02:34.946
Be quiet, guys!

02:35.572 --> 02:37.115
Quiet, you pricks!

02:37.198 --> 02:39.242
One more down! I got them all!

02:42.203 --> 02:43.037
DAD

02:44.164 --> 02:45.081
Hey.

02:45.999 --> 02:48.001
Okay, I'll come now. All right.

02:48.501 --> 02:49.544
I'll be right back.

02:49.627 --> 02:50.712
-Be quick.
-All right.

03:01.514 --> 03:04.017
MIGHTY CHICKEN

03:09.564 --> 03:11.232
-Be safe.
-Okay!

03:30.418 --> 03:31.753
Hey, Auntie.

03:38.176 --> 03:39.928
This is on the house.

03:41.095 --> 03:43.431
Oh my. You read my mind.

03:44.349 --> 03:46.684
Hey! Come get your roots done next week.

03:47.268 --> 03:48.269
Should I?

03:51.022 --> 03:52.565
Hey, I'm on my way now.

03:53.233 --> 03:54.317
We're playing now.

03:54.943 --> 03:55.777
Hurry up.

03:56.861 --> 03:57.862
He wants you to hurry.

03:57.946 --> 03:58.780
All right.

04:00.823 --> 04:02.408
Stop. That's enough!

04:02.492 --> 04:04.410
Fuck! Why are you messing with me?

04:10.416 --> 04:11.334
Fuck you!

04:12.252 --> 04:13.419
What do we have here?

04:15.588 --> 04:16.965
You son of a bitch!

04:20.551 --> 04:21.594
Come at me.

04:21.678 --> 04:23.513
Bring it on. Goddamn it!

04:25.765 --> 04:26.849
Son of a bitch.

04:30.061 --> 04:31.271
Damn it! Get off me!

04:31.354 --> 04:32.355
-Fuck, get off!
-Stop!

04:32.438 --> 04:33.523
Fuck!

04:34.565 --> 04:35.400
Let me…

04:37.235 --> 04:38.111
Fine. I'll go.

04:43.658 --> 04:44.701
Damn it.

04:45.743 --> 04:47.370
I won't cuff you, so let's just go.

04:47.453 --> 04:48.413
Okay.

04:51.708 --> 04:52.625
Fuck!

04:53.501 --> 04:54.502
Fuck you.

04:55.086 --> 04:56.587
-Fuck!
-Hey now.

04:57.755 --> 04:58.965
You son of a bitch!

05:03.386 --> 05:06.264
All right, stop! Break it up!

05:07.140 --> 05:08.266
He's hurt.

05:08.349 --> 05:09.809
Who the fuck are you?

05:10.727 --> 05:11.686
You son of a bitch.

05:14.439 --> 05:15.732
-You piece of--
-Stop.

05:25.491 --> 05:26.492
Who is this jerk?

05:30.747 --> 05:32.707
-Are you all right?
-Yes.

05:34.167 --> 05:35.418
-Thank you.
-No problem.

05:35.918 --> 05:38.671
You helped us prevent a crisis.
Thank you so much.

05:38.755 --> 05:40.006
Sure. No problem.

05:41.257 --> 05:42.342
On the count of three.

05:42.425 --> 05:44.052
SEOUL CENTRAL DISTRICT PROBATION OFFICE

05:44.135 --> 05:45.636
Three, two, one.

05:46.679 --> 05:48.598
-His physique is impressive.
-I know.

05:49.349 --> 05:50.975
-Thank you so much.
-My pleasure.

05:51.059 --> 05:52.226
-Take care.
-Thank you.

05:54.437 --> 05:55.688
This is my manager.

05:55.772 --> 05:56.689
I see.

05:56.773 --> 05:59.734
-Jung-do. It's so nice to meet you.
-Hello.

05:59.817 --> 06:03.237
I'm Kim Sun-min, manager
of the Electronic Monitoring Division.

06:03.321 --> 06:04.447
I see.

06:04.530 --> 06:07.075
Could you spare a few minutes?

06:07.158 --> 06:07.992
Sure.

06:10.078 --> 06:14.499
There are about 5,000 ex-cons
wearing electronic ankle tags nationwide.

06:14.999 --> 06:18.711
They've committed violent crimes
like sexual violence or homicide.

06:19.212 --> 06:22.298
Their recidivism rate is high.
That's why probation officers like me…

06:22.382 --> 06:23.883
MANAGER KIM SUN-MIN
MINISTRY OF JUSTICE

06:23.966 --> 06:28.221
…monitor them 24-7,
using GPS-enabled ankle monitors.

06:28.805 --> 06:31.182
Then the guy I helped that day
must also be--

06:31.265 --> 06:34.560
That was Mr. Cho,
our martial arts officer.

06:35.978 --> 06:39.148
The ex-cons we monitor
cause trouble from time to time.

06:39.982 --> 06:42.402
When that occurs,
we must rush to the scene promptly

06:42.485 --> 06:45.071
and take care of it
to ensure public safety.

06:45.154 --> 06:47.907
But middle-aged men
with beer bellies like me

06:48.408 --> 06:51.911
aren't really capable of overpowering
or catching them, you know.

06:51.994 --> 06:56.499
That's why each probation officer works
with a strong young partner.

06:56.582 --> 06:59.669
We call them martial arts officers.

06:59.752 --> 07:02.296
I see. "Martial arts officers."

07:02.797 --> 07:05.716
What do you do for a living, Jung-do?

07:06.300 --> 07:09.762
I work as a deliveryman
for my father's chicken joint.

07:09.846 --> 07:15.810
Well, Mr. Cho said
it looked like you do tae kwon do or judo.

07:16.436 --> 07:17.520
Is that true?

07:17.603 --> 07:21.190
Yes. I'm a third dan
in both tae kwon do and judo.

07:21.274 --> 07:22.316
Wow!

07:22.400 --> 07:24.318
A third dan in kendo too.

07:26.988 --> 07:28.531
Could I ask you a favor?

07:28.614 --> 07:29.782
No.

07:32.160 --> 07:34.078
Yes, of course. Ask away.

07:35.872 --> 07:36.706
The thing is,

07:36.789 --> 07:41.043
the martial arts officers in our division
are on a triple-shift rotation.

07:41.127 --> 07:42.837
But with Mr. Cho injured,

07:42.920 --> 07:47.842
the other two martial arts officers
must work 12-hour shifts for five weeks.

07:48.426 --> 07:50.845
They'll work a 12-hour shift,

07:51.345 --> 07:54.015
then return 12 hours later,
repeating the cycle.

07:54.098 --> 07:56.392
-That's intense.
-Exactly.

07:57.101 --> 07:59.270
Our work isn't easy.

07:59.353 --> 08:01.939
Realistically, it's impossible
to find a replacement

08:02.023 --> 08:04.775
for just the five weeks
Mr. Cho needs to recover.

08:04.859 --> 08:07.904
But Mr. Cho told me

08:07.987 --> 08:11.699
that when he saw you
take down the ex-con that day,

08:12.366 --> 08:18.498
he thought it would be great
if you could lend us a hand.

08:18.581 --> 08:22.001
Wait. But do I qualify?

08:22.752 --> 08:25.755
You can apply
to become a martial arts officer

08:25.838 --> 08:31.093
with a third dan or higher
in tae kwon do, kendo, judo, or hapkido.

08:31.177 --> 08:33.304
You most definitely qualify, Jung-do.

08:33.387 --> 08:35.097
But is it…

08:36.140 --> 08:39.727
Well, is it fun? That's important to me.

08:42.688 --> 08:46.108
The definition of "fun"
can be different for everyone.

08:46.859 --> 08:47.902
But I promise you

08:47.985 --> 08:50.530
that it's a rewarding job
that we're proud to do.

08:51.197 --> 08:53.491
We're keeping innocent people safe,
you know?

08:56.619 --> 08:58.621
Well, is that fun?

09:02.208 --> 09:03.209
I think

09:04.335 --> 09:09.382
you'll learn a lot while working with us.

09:12.260 --> 09:14.387
I've researched extensively
for my stories.

09:14.887 --> 09:17.515
People wearing ankle tags
are serious criminals.

09:17.598 --> 09:20.518
Your job would be catching them,
so it might suit you well.

09:20.601 --> 09:22.478
-Why?
-You love thrilling activities.

09:22.562 --> 09:24.689
-I think you'd like it too.
-Right?

09:28.067 --> 09:30.570
What's your take
on me as a martial arts officer?

09:31.988 --> 09:34.657
-Triple shift sounds tough.
-Why would it be tough?

09:34.740 --> 09:37.493
-It'll ruin his sleep cycle.
-Diarrhea is fit. He'll be fine.

09:37.577 --> 09:39.412
-I'll be fine.
-It'd still be hard.

09:39.495 --> 09:41.038
Can you stop being so indecisive?

09:41.122 --> 09:42.623
How about you stop being bossy?

09:42.707 --> 09:44.083
You're making me like that.

09:48.546 --> 09:50.715
I'd have to go catch them
if things went south.

09:51.507 --> 09:52.675
What do you think, Dad?

09:53.968 --> 09:57.388
I'd be happy to see you
take on new challenges and learn.

09:58.264 --> 10:00.975
You received a commendation.
I'm proud of you.

10:02.143 --> 10:03.144
Really?

10:05.396 --> 10:06.439
Give it a shot.

10:07.023 --> 10:09.317
I'll manage this place. Don't worry.

10:14.947 --> 10:15.781
All right.

10:22.747 --> 10:24.540
SEOUL CENTRAL DISTRICT PROBATION OFFICE

10:24.624 --> 10:26.584
Can I have your attention for a moment?

10:27.877 --> 10:32.423
This is Mr. Lee Jung-do.
He'll help us while Mr. Cho is recovering.

10:32.506 --> 10:34.550
Let's give him a warm round of applause.

10:35.176 --> 10:36.010
Hello.

10:38.471 --> 10:40.931
Meet Mr. Huh Dong-won,
our senior martial arts officer.

10:41.891 --> 10:42.933
Hello.

10:43.017 --> 10:46.145
Mr. Huh will show you
how to use the program.

10:46.228 --> 10:47.063
Okay.

10:47.146 --> 10:49.398
-Take good care of him.
-Don't worry, sir.

10:50.441 --> 10:53.235
There. All those ex-cons
are under surveillance.

10:56.197 --> 10:58.741
One of them raped a ten-year-old boy,

10:58.824 --> 11:00.951
and another killed his own parents.

11:01.035 --> 11:02.119
JANG HO-SIK
87%/HOMICIDE

11:02.870 --> 11:07.667
When the ankle tag's battery drops to 30%,
these icons turn yellow.

11:08.167 --> 11:12.755
Then we call them and ask them nicely
to recharge their ankle tags.

11:12.838 --> 11:17.343
But what would you do
if they refused to recharge it?

11:19.387 --> 11:20.221
Go there?

11:21.514 --> 11:22.348
-Yes.
-Go there.

11:22.431 --> 11:23.265
Right.

11:23.349 --> 11:26.310
You'll be overwhelmed
if I explain everything now.

11:26.852 --> 11:30.981
For now, if you're unsure of anything,
just ask Mr. Kim.

11:31.899 --> 11:32.733
Okay.

11:32.817 --> 11:33.734
Good.

11:47.331 --> 11:51.001
I'm just calling
because your battery is at 30% now.

11:51.085 --> 11:52.461
You should recharge it.

11:53.129 --> 11:54.839
You're out with a friend? I see.

11:54.922 --> 11:57.174
-He's doing better than expected.
-Really?

11:57.258 --> 11:59.176
I'm so glad to hear that.

12:11.021 --> 12:11.981
LOW BATTERY DETECTED

12:12.064 --> 12:13.691
LEE YANG-HO
30%/SEX CRIME

12:14.483 --> 12:15.818
DATE OF BIRTH - MAY 24, 2003

12:15.901 --> 12:16.736
He's 20?

12:19.029 --> 12:20.281
How did it go?

12:20.948 --> 12:22.742
I told Choi Jong-hwa to go home.

12:22.825 --> 12:27.496
But he swore at me and pushed me,
so I had to struggle a little.

12:41.552 --> 12:42.386
Hello?

12:42.470 --> 12:45.264
Is this Mr. Lee Yang-ho?

12:45.347 --> 12:46.515
-Yes.
-All right.

12:47.224 --> 12:50.019
I'm calling to remind you
to recharge your ankle tag.

12:50.102 --> 12:53.230
-Who is it, babe?
-I didn't order any jjajangmyeon.

12:53.856 --> 12:54.690
Wait…

12:56.150 --> 12:57.276
Jjajangmyeon?

12:58.027 --> 12:58.861
REDIAL

13:02.990 --> 13:04.283
The call got disconnected.

13:04.366 --> 13:07.536
I heard you, motherfucker. Beat it.

13:08.245 --> 13:09.079
Hello?

13:15.753 --> 13:19.507
This phone is turned off.
Please leave a message after the tone.

13:19.590 --> 13:21.050
Extra charges may apply.

13:25.137 --> 13:26.263
-Send a text.
-Yes, sir.

13:26.347 --> 13:27.181
-And--
-Mr. Kim.

13:28.349 --> 13:30.017
We should go.

13:30.768 --> 13:31.894
What? Go where?

13:31.977 --> 13:36.857
Mr. Lee Yang-ho hung up on me twice.

13:36.941 --> 13:39.401
-When was he released?
-Three months ago.

13:39.485 --> 13:42.363
He seemed to be behaving
when we talked last week.

13:43.155 --> 13:44.949
-Give Jung-do what he needs.
-Yes, sir.

13:45.449 --> 13:47.326
-Let's meet in the parking lot.
-Yes, sir.

13:51.080 --> 13:52.540
-Come with me.
-Sure.

13:59.880 --> 14:01.215
-A stab-proof vest.
-Right.

14:02.299 --> 14:03.133
It's heavy.

14:07.054 --> 14:08.639
Can this really stop a knife?

14:08.722 --> 14:09.640
It prevents cuts,

14:09.723 --> 14:11.767
but a strong stab
can still cause bruising.

14:12.268 --> 14:14.937
Don't forget to turn on your bodycam
before moving in.

14:16.814 --> 14:18.190
Here's your Taser.

14:20.901 --> 14:22.069
Can I actually use it?

14:22.653 --> 14:24.196
If Mr. Kim permits, yes.

14:24.697 --> 14:25.698
Put it in here.

14:30.202 --> 14:31.704
How did he end up in jail?

14:31.787 --> 14:33.372
He raped a middle school girl.

14:35.040 --> 14:35.875
Whoa.

14:39.753 --> 14:41.755
Is it okay if I use the Taser?

14:41.839 --> 14:43.591
Only if it's absolutely necessary.

14:44.174 --> 14:49.388
Our priority is to monitor the ex-cons
and keep them out of trouble.

14:50.556 --> 14:51.390
Right.

15:04.320 --> 15:06.655
What is it, Jung-do?
Did you see something?

15:09.033 --> 15:11.869
This is unit 201, where Lee Yang-ho lives.

15:12.620 --> 15:16.457
I've delivered to many buildings,
so I get the gist with a glance.

15:17.499 --> 15:20.419
If you take a look,
there are no security grilles.

15:20.920 --> 15:22.463
Look. This unit has them.

15:22.546 --> 15:24.757
He removed them intentionally to escape.

15:26.383 --> 15:28.052
If you knock on his door,

15:28.969 --> 15:32.765
he'll probably sneak out through here,
so I'll wait here and catch him.

15:33.641 --> 15:35.017
What if he uses the door?

15:37.853 --> 15:39.271
Then I'll run in right away.

15:41.231 --> 15:42.107
Yes.

15:50.908 --> 15:51.825
Hey, stop.

16:02.294 --> 16:03.212
Lee Yang-ho.

16:04.463 --> 16:06.173
-Open the door.
-It's nothing.

16:06.256 --> 16:07.967
I know you're inside.

16:15.641 --> 16:17.434
You're inside, right?

16:17.518 --> 16:19.311
-Fucking bastard.
-I know what's up.

16:20.521 --> 16:22.022
Yang-ho, I know you're…

16:22.106 --> 16:23.023
Fuck.

16:23.816 --> 16:25.359
You son of a bitch!

16:25.442 --> 16:26.986
Fuck, I told you not to come.

16:27.069 --> 16:28.904
-Help!
-You piece of shit.

16:28.988 --> 16:30.322
-Open it, and you're dead!
-Open!

16:30.406 --> 16:32.408
-Get lost, fucking asshole.
-Lee Yang-ho.

16:33.242 --> 16:34.660
Open the door now!

16:35.202 --> 16:36.036
No!

16:36.120 --> 16:38.163
What is it? What's wrong?

16:39.707 --> 16:41.583
Open the door! Open up!

16:43.252 --> 16:44.628
Mister, please help me.

16:45.462 --> 16:47.089
-Shit.
-Please.

17:14.408 --> 17:15.492
That's dope!

17:19.955 --> 17:20.789
Mr. Kim.

17:25.544 --> 17:29.131
Lee Yang-ho, you are under arrest
for violating electronic monitoring terms

17:29.214 --> 17:32.384
and disobeying
your probation officer's instructions.

17:33.052 --> 17:35.304
You have the right to remain silent.

17:35.387 --> 17:38.724
Anything you say can
and will be used against you in court.

17:38.807 --> 17:42.603
You have the right to an attorney.

17:50.986 --> 17:51.945
ABNORMAL MOVEMENT DETECTED

17:53.864 --> 17:55.491
LEE JONG-IN
82%/SEX CRIME

17:57.076 --> 17:58.327
HIGH-RISK AREA - CHILDCARE FACILITIES

18:00.537 --> 18:01.497
Mr. Kim.

18:03.082 --> 18:04.583
JUNGANG DAY CARE CENTER

18:11.381 --> 18:12.216
Wait, stop.

18:20.015 --> 18:21.433
Hey!

18:21.517 --> 18:22.518
What the fuck?

18:33.278 --> 18:34.905
-You son of a bitch.
-What?

18:34.988 --> 18:36.698
-"What"?
-Yeah, what are you gonna do, huh?

18:36.782 --> 18:37.950
-You lunatic!
-Calm down.

18:38.033 --> 18:40.452
-Go on. Hit me, you bastard.
-Calm down.

18:41.203 --> 18:42.621
He's trying to provoke you.

18:42.704 --> 18:44.289
Calm down. You need to relax.

18:44.915 --> 18:48.168
I'm not trying to provoke you, moron.
Show me what you've got!

18:48.252 --> 18:49.795
-Shut your trap, asshole!
-Don't.

18:50.462 --> 18:52.506
Stop talking. I won't repeat myself.

18:52.589 --> 18:55.008
I know. I understand how you feel.

18:55.759 --> 18:57.678
Hey, I get it. Calm down.

19:10.149 --> 19:10.983
Jung-do.

19:12.734 --> 19:13.902
I'm sorry.

19:13.986 --> 19:15.487
Don't be. That was cool.

19:16.113 --> 19:17.197
Thank you.

19:17.281 --> 19:19.700
Good job today.
How about a drink and some pork belly?

19:22.077 --> 19:25.205
I'm supposed to meet up with my friends.

19:25.289 --> 19:26.290
Another time, then.

19:26.373 --> 19:28.083
Could you take us all out for dinner?

19:31.336 --> 19:32.838
-Sure!
-Really?

19:32.921 --> 19:34.381
-Of course.
-Thank you.

19:34.882 --> 19:35.883
It's no biggie.

19:39.678 --> 19:41.054
MANAGER'S BUYING US PORK BELLY

19:44.224 --> 19:45.893
Diarrhea's manager is treating us.

19:47.936 --> 19:50.147
CAST IRON KIMCHI AND PORK BELLY

19:51.899 --> 19:52.816
-Hello.
-Hello.

19:52.900 --> 19:55.402
Yes, hello.

19:55.485 --> 19:57.779
I'm Writer K.
I've heard so much about you.

19:57.863 --> 20:00.782
I'm Kim Sun-min. It's nice to meet you.

20:00.866 --> 20:03.952
Hello, I'm Moisture.
Thank you for inviting us.

20:04.536 --> 20:07.581
My pleasure.
Anyway, why are you called "Moisture"?

20:08.332 --> 20:11.460
His nose is always wet.
That's why he is Moisture.

20:11.960 --> 20:14.004
No one knows whether it's sweat or grease.

20:14.087 --> 20:15.797
I say it's half-sweat, half-grease.

20:17.466 --> 20:19.801
-And this is Earthworm.
-"Earthworm"?

20:19.885 --> 20:21.887
I only squirm when I'm stepped on.

20:22.679 --> 20:25.557
He's too nice. He never gets angry.

20:27.017 --> 20:28.352
All right, guys. Take a seat.

20:28.435 --> 20:29.269
Okay.

20:29.353 --> 20:30.938
-Please, sir.
-Yes, of course.

20:32.564 --> 20:33.857
What are you in the mood for?

20:36.235 --> 20:40.030
We can start with the savory combination
of water celery and pork belly,

20:40.113 --> 20:42.491
move to the spicy kimchi stew
to cut the grease,

20:42.574 --> 20:44.326
and end with the crispy fried rice.

20:44.409 --> 20:47.579
I think it's a perfectly balanced meal
with carbs, protein, and fat.

20:48.956 --> 20:50.666
-Order anything you want.
-Thank you.

20:50.749 --> 20:51.917
No problem.

20:53.502 --> 20:54.670
Like he was telling a story.

20:55.671 --> 20:58.131
-Twenty servings?
-And five servings of kimchi stew.

20:58.215 --> 21:01.677
-Twenty-five servings in total?
-Yes, including five servings of stew.

21:04.054 --> 21:05.180
Let me pour you one.

21:05.264 --> 21:07.766
I don't have the enzymes
to break down alcohol.

21:08.475 --> 21:10.435
But I party harder than the drunk.

21:10.519 --> 21:12.145
Okay, all right. Here.

21:12.229 --> 21:13.188
Thank you.

21:14.022 --> 21:15.732
It's so nice to meet you, Moisture.

21:15.816 --> 21:17.192
-Earthworm too.
-Likewise.

21:19.361 --> 21:21.863
-All right, shall we drink?
-Yes.

21:21.947 --> 21:24.366
-Cheers.
-Cheers.

21:29.454 --> 21:33.417
I did some research on probation officers
while working on a script some time ago.

21:33.500 --> 21:34.334
Right. I see.

21:34.418 --> 21:38.255
It's a very stressful job
that involves dangerous tasks.

21:38.755 --> 21:40.382
Why did you decide to become one?

21:40.465 --> 21:43.677
I was in a car accident when I was little.

21:44.970 --> 21:47.097
You see, our car wasn't even moving.

21:47.681 --> 21:50.892
But this car came out of nowhere
and crashed into ours!

21:50.976 --> 21:56.023
The rear doors caved in,
and I couldn't move as my legs were stuck.

21:57.232 --> 21:59.818
Then the engine caught fire.

22:00.319 --> 22:01.486
I was only ten.

22:02.404 --> 22:05.032
A ten-year-old boy thought he was dying.

22:05.115 --> 22:06.783
"Is this how I die?"

22:06.867 --> 22:10.579
"If I'd known I'd end up like this,
I would've played more games!"

22:10.662 --> 22:13.665
I had my money from New Years
saved up in a drawer.

22:13.749 --> 22:16.126
I couldn't stop thinking about it!

22:17.836 --> 22:19.004
Anyway, at that moment,

22:19.838 --> 22:25.510
some cops showed up
and tore the door off to save me.

22:26.303 --> 22:29.973
So I told myself
I'd become a police officer

22:30.057 --> 22:34.561
to save people
and repay the favor I had received.

22:35.187 --> 22:39.649
But the accident damaged
the growth plate in my left leg,

22:39.733 --> 22:41.443
so it's shorter than my right leg.

22:42.277 --> 22:45.947
I knew I wouldn't be able to run around
to catch criminals,

22:46.782 --> 22:50.077
so I did a lot of thinking
to figure out what I could do.

22:51.078 --> 22:53.497
That's when I learned
about probation officers.

22:54.373 --> 22:58.668
Contributing to reducing recidivism
deeply motivated me.

22:59.419 --> 23:04.216
After I got married and became a father,
my job became even more meaningful to me.

23:04.299 --> 23:05.467
Why is that?

23:05.550 --> 23:10.222
Several of the ex-convicts we monitor
are child sex offenders.

23:10.931 --> 23:15.644
I want to build a world where children
are always safe and protected.

23:33.161 --> 23:34.371
-Enjoy.
-Thank you.

23:35.122 --> 23:36.248
Let's do this.

23:38.125 --> 23:40.210
You know, what we want

23:41.253 --> 23:43.213
is to call you our big brother.

23:43.296 --> 23:44.297
Garlic too.

23:44.381 --> 23:47.592
But in order to do so,
you have to pass a test first.

23:47.676 --> 23:49.177
Add some more.

23:49.261 --> 23:54.182
This lettuce wrap is filled
with loyalty, friendship, and sincerity.

23:54.933 --> 23:57.561
All you have to do
is eat this in one bite.

23:57.644 --> 23:59.146
Open up.

24:07.737 --> 24:10.365
Big bro!

24:10.449 --> 24:12.033
This is way too big!

24:12.117 --> 24:15.328
Big bro!

24:33.638 --> 24:34.848
LOW BATTERY DETECTED

24:36.600 --> 24:37.684
HAN JUN-GU
30%/KIDNAPPING

24:42.856 --> 24:44.733
This phone is turned off. Please leave--

24:44.816 --> 24:47.694
Han Jun-gu's battery is at 30%,
but his phone is off.

24:50.906 --> 24:52.282
What is this?

24:52.991 --> 24:53.825
Who is it?

24:54.576 --> 24:56.036
MIN DO-WOONG

24:56.119 --> 24:58.246
Thank you for such a great meal.

24:58.330 --> 25:01.082
-What are you guys doing?
-Thanks for the dinner, big bro!

25:01.166 --> 25:02.334
You're making me blush.

25:02.417 --> 25:05.253
You'd really be going wild
if I had treated you to beef.

25:08.006 --> 25:09.549
ASSISTANT MANAGER YOON DONG-JU

25:11.176 --> 25:12.010
Hey.

25:12.093 --> 25:14.012
Sir, where are you?

25:14.095 --> 25:14.971
What's up?

25:15.055 --> 25:18.517
An ex-con is unreachable,
so we have to go to Bukrin-dong.

25:18.600 --> 25:22.687
But Min Do-woong from Seorin-dong
is out and about after curfew.

25:22.771 --> 25:23.772
He's not answering.

25:24.481 --> 25:27.275
I'm actually in Seorin-dong now,
so I'll go.

25:27.776 --> 25:30.237
What did Min Do-woong do time for?

25:30.320 --> 25:33.490
Involuntary manslaughter, 20 years.
He was released three months ago.

25:33.573 --> 25:35.951
Does he have a grudge
against someone in Seorin-dong?

25:36.034 --> 25:38.954
I haven't figured that out yet. I'm sorry.

25:39.037 --> 25:40.789
Okay. Got it.

25:42.374 --> 25:45.418
Big bro, we can get there
in five minutes if we run.

25:48.588 --> 25:49.506
One minute will do.

25:58.723 --> 26:00.392
CRIME CATEGORY - MANSLAUGHTER

26:04.521 --> 26:06.439
You guys stay in the car. It's dangerous.

26:06.523 --> 26:08.024
-Yes, sir.
-We'll be back.

26:13.947 --> 26:14.948
-That way.
-Okay.

26:23.707 --> 26:24.583
What's happening?

26:25.250 --> 26:26.293
He cut the tag off.

26:26.376 --> 26:27.335
How do we find him?

26:28.211 --> 26:29.379
-Let's go see.
-Okay.

26:32.048 --> 26:33.216
Hey, over here.

26:36.803 --> 26:38.179
He cut it off with a knife.

26:48.857 --> 26:49.941
Should we call the cops?

26:50.025 --> 26:52.068
No, he must be close. Let's find him fast.

26:53.278 --> 26:55.697
Hey, Moisture has a drone.
Why don't we use it?

26:56.364 --> 26:58.325
-Would it help?
-Let's give it a shot.

27:06.207 --> 27:08.293
-You can view it here.
-Okay.

27:15.216 --> 27:16.176
Here.

27:16.259 --> 27:17.969
-Can you fly it here?
-Yes.

27:22.891 --> 27:23.975
That must be him.

27:24.601 --> 27:25.727
Where's he going?

27:27.354 --> 27:29.356
-I'll go after him.
-I'll come with you.

27:29.439 --> 27:31.900
No, I'll run over there and get him.

27:32.567 --> 27:33.777
He's carrying a knife.

27:34.277 --> 27:35.654
Don't worry about that.

27:38.323 --> 27:41.201
A martial arts officer
must protect their probation officer.

27:42.410 --> 27:43.244
I'll go.

27:44.371 --> 27:45.497
What a fool.

27:46.748 --> 27:49.459
Use the earbud. I'll give you directions.

27:49.542 --> 27:50.377
Okay.

27:51.211 --> 27:52.045
I'll be back!

27:52.629 --> 27:53.463
Be careful.

28:00.845 --> 28:02.681
Go straight. Keep going straight.

28:02.764 --> 28:03.640
Make a left turn.

28:03.723 --> 28:05.392
You went past it. Go back.

28:14.025 --> 28:14.901
Hurry.

28:17.445 --> 28:20.699
Jung-do. I'm really sorry,
but can you run a little faster?

28:21.866 --> 28:23.284
You're almost there.

28:23.868 --> 28:26.413
A little faster.
You can get him. Turn right there.

28:27.414 --> 28:28.498
On your right…

28:28.581 --> 28:30.166
On my right? Where?

28:30.250 --> 28:31.543
Where? This way?

28:31.626 --> 28:33.294
See the two buildings with rooftops?

28:33.878 --> 28:35.380
He's right behind them.

28:35.463 --> 28:36.381
Two rooftops?

28:36.464 --> 28:37.549
Don't you see them?

28:38.550 --> 28:40.260
One, two. Okay, got it.

28:51.104 --> 28:53.857
Hey, bastard!
Come out, you son of a bitch!

28:56.609 --> 28:57.610
Come out!

28:58.111 --> 28:59.863
Ji Hyeok-jun, you bastard!

29:00.447 --> 29:01.364
Come out, asshole!

29:01.448 --> 29:03.199
I'll kill you! Come out!

29:04.909 --> 29:05.744
Min Do-woong!

29:09.497 --> 29:10.415
Who are you?

29:11.875 --> 29:12.709
I'm…

29:16.212 --> 29:17.881
I'm a martial arts officer.

29:19.048 --> 29:19.883
Get lost.

29:21.301 --> 29:23.136
I'm here to finish it all off.

29:25.472 --> 29:27.056
That's why I'm here.

29:28.767 --> 29:30.018
Let's go back quietly.

29:30.643 --> 29:31.686
That's right.

29:46.493 --> 29:49.204
Jung-do, what's wrong?
Jung-do, are you all--

29:52.832 --> 29:53.833
You little…

30:05.386 --> 30:06.429
You can come now.

30:08.556 --> 30:10.099
Okay, I'm coming now.

30:14.437 --> 30:15.605
Shit.

30:16.856 --> 30:17.690
Hey!

30:19.234 --> 30:20.985
Get lost, or I'll kill myself.

30:24.906 --> 30:26.032
Bro, I need your help.

30:28.701 --> 30:29.661
What's going on?

30:30.161 --> 30:32.330
He's holding a knife to his own throat.

30:39.254 --> 30:41.965
Hey, Jung-do. I need you to be my voice.

30:42.048 --> 30:42.966
Sorry?

30:43.466 --> 30:45.927
Repeat my exact words to him.

30:46.427 --> 30:47.303
Leave!

30:48.221 --> 30:49.305
Okay.

30:50.056 --> 30:51.182
Mr. Min Do-woong.

30:52.642 --> 30:53.893
"Mr. Min Do-woong."

30:54.769 --> 30:57.105
You must've had a bad day.

30:59.065 --> 31:01.401
"You must've had a bad day."

31:05.321 --> 31:09.033
Did you get into a fight with a friend?

31:10.451 --> 31:12.829
"Did you get into a fight with a friend?"

31:20.712 --> 31:25.466
I'm trying really hard
to lead a good life.

31:27.260 --> 31:29.220
But that son of a bitch

31:30.138 --> 31:34.183
kept mocking me about my ankle tag
in front of everyone.

31:35.393 --> 31:39.939
It's not fair. It makes me so angry
that I can't even sleep.

31:41.774 --> 31:43.610
I'll kill that son of a bitch,

31:44.444 --> 31:46.029
and kill myself too!

31:46.863 --> 31:47.697
Mr. Min.

31:48.656 --> 31:49.490
"Mr. Min."

31:51.826 --> 31:55.538
"You were exhausted,
yet still had to endure such insults."

31:56.372 --> 31:59.542
I understand why
you want to give up on everything.

32:01.127 --> 32:02.211
"But if you do,

32:04.255 --> 32:06.966
don't you think
spending more than 20 years repenting

32:08.176 --> 32:09.510
would have been in vain?"

32:15.767 --> 32:18.478
Let's just say you were upset today,
and had too much to drink.

32:19.187 --> 32:23.274
I'll write a favorable report
so you receive just a minor penalty.

32:23.358 --> 32:25.568
"I'll do my best."

32:29.739 --> 32:31.324
"So please put down the knife."

32:35.870 --> 32:37.747
You must not repeat the same mistake.

32:38.831 --> 32:40.416
"To persevere is to win."

32:41.793 --> 32:43.419
"Hang in there a little longer."

32:44.295 --> 32:46.714
"Your ankle tag will be removed one day."

32:48.883 --> 32:51.302
"I'll stay by your side
and help you until then."

32:53.346 --> 32:54.305
I mean it.

32:56.933 --> 32:57.934
"I mean it."

33:16.828 --> 33:18.454
-I'm home.
-Welcome back.

33:19.664 --> 33:21.791
-How was work?
-Not too bad.

33:24.335 --> 33:26.254
Well, my manager…

33:28.297 --> 33:29.257
He's a really

33:30.717 --> 33:31.592
good guy.

33:34.053 --> 33:34.887
Good.

33:35.596 --> 33:37.932
-Wash up quickly and have an apple.
-All right.

33:39.100 --> 33:41.310
Kang Ki-jung managed
to evade the police for four years…

33:41.394 --> 33:43.688
KWON IL-YONG
FORMER POLICE PROFILER

33:43.771 --> 33:45.231
…starting in May 1998,

33:45.732 --> 33:50.278
and sexually assaulted
15 girls under the age of 13.

33:50.903 --> 33:52.864
What a scoundrel.

33:53.614 --> 33:58.244
…and has a history
of over ten convictions,

33:58.327 --> 34:01.330
so we can say
that Kang has a higher risk of recidivism,

34:01.414 --> 34:04.959
even compared to other sex offenders.

34:05.793 --> 34:07.920
How should we organize the task force?

34:08.671 --> 34:10.006
We need three teams,

34:10.089 --> 34:13.176
with a probation officer
and a martial arts officer on each,

34:13.259 --> 34:15.344
on a triple-shift rotation
to monitor Kang.

34:15.428 --> 34:16.596
A triple-shift rotation?

34:17.847 --> 34:21.809
Each probation officer has to monitor
over 20 ex-convicts at the moment.

34:22.310 --> 34:24.729
If we monitor Kang Ki-jung on top of that,

34:24.812 --> 34:28.024
we won't be able
to closely monitor the others.

34:28.733 --> 34:30.902
I know you're all working very hard.

34:32.028 --> 34:35.281
The problem is that it isn't easy
to increase the budget,

34:35.364 --> 34:37.033
but I'll push harder for it.

34:40.453 --> 34:43.623
Thank you. Come again. Have a nice day.

34:51.005 --> 34:52.048
Hey, Auntie.

34:57.011 --> 34:59.097
I'm very well, thank you.

35:03.017 --> 35:04.977
Do you want to bleach your roots today?

35:08.523 --> 35:10.191
Then what do you want to do?

35:11.901 --> 35:13.569
I want a clean cut, Auntie.

35:24.956 --> 35:27.125
SAEMGOL CHARCOAL GRILLED ENTRAILS

36:00.366 --> 36:01.325
Hello, Mr. Huh.

36:01.409 --> 36:02.577
-Hey, Jung-do.
-Hello.

36:02.660 --> 36:04.036
You're really early today.

36:04.120 --> 36:04.954
Yes.

36:05.872 --> 36:07.290
You changed your hairstyle.

36:07.373 --> 36:09.250
-I did.
-Nice. It looks great.

36:10.168 --> 36:11.002
Thank you.

36:23.764 --> 36:25.391
KIM GUM-NAM
79%/SEX CRIME

36:30.563 --> 36:32.273
CRIME CATEGORY - SEX CRIME

36:33.900 --> 36:35.776
HIGH-RISK

36:36.360 --> 36:38.154
Another cold bottle, please.

36:39.989 --> 36:40.823
Okay.

36:48.039 --> 36:50.291
KIM GUM-NAM
79%/SEX CRIME

36:57.131 --> 36:58.341
Hello.

36:58.424 --> 36:59.884
That's a nice hairstyle.

36:59.967 --> 37:02.136
Thank you. Hello, sirs.

37:02.220 --> 37:05.598
I saw this man on my way here.

37:05.681 --> 37:06.557
A moment, please.

37:08.351 --> 37:12.271
I saw him tip a young female server
and touch her hand.

37:12.355 --> 37:14.607
He's on the move now.
Shouldn't we head there?

37:19.362 --> 37:20.988
Maybe he's on his way home.

37:22.448 --> 37:24.367
-Let's try calling him.
-Yes, sir.

37:35.795 --> 37:38.422
I'm gonna do
whatever the fuck I want tonight.

37:40.758 --> 37:42.093
We have a problem. Hurry!

37:47.139 --> 37:47.974
What?

37:48.557 --> 37:49.558
Did he cut it off?

37:50.059 --> 37:51.978
I think he went into a place
with no connection.

37:52.061 --> 37:53.062
WARNING
DEVICE SIGNAL LOST

37:53.646 --> 37:55.064
Where did you see him last?

37:55.147 --> 37:57.900
SAEMGOL CHARCOAL GRILLED ENTRAILS

38:06.284 --> 38:07.827
Excuse me.

38:08.995 --> 38:10.955
Do you remember this man?

38:11.038 --> 38:11.998
Yes.

38:12.081 --> 38:13.291
Which way did he go?

38:16.460 --> 38:17.712
Left or right?

38:17.795 --> 38:19.171
I didn't see which way.

38:20.965 --> 38:24.051
He said it was his birthday today
and invited me to his place,

38:24.135 --> 38:25.094
but I said no.

38:26.470 --> 38:27.805
-Yes.
-Thank you.

38:27.888 --> 38:28.723
Thank you.

38:32.685 --> 38:34.854
I'll go this way. You go that way.

38:34.937 --> 38:36.063
Okay, got it.

38:37.273 --> 38:38.607
-Jung-do!
-Yes.

38:38.691 --> 38:40.359
He'll target a woman working alone.

38:41.193 --> 38:42.069
Got it!

38:45.197 --> 38:48.117
If it gets too hot, just let me know.

38:50.202 --> 38:51.120
-Hello.
-Excuse me.

38:51.203 --> 38:53.039
You're okay, right?

38:53.122 --> 38:54.123
Sorry?

38:54.206 --> 38:56.083
No, never mind. Stay inside.

39:40.795 --> 39:41.796
What do you need?

39:45.925 --> 39:47.468
Why did you lock the door?

39:56.811 --> 39:57.895
What do you want?

40:35.808 --> 40:38.727
You did fucking tell me to come again.

40:47.445 --> 40:48.696
Auntie!

40:49.822 --> 40:51.073
You bastard!

41:03.210 --> 41:05.463
Auntie, are you all right?

41:07.298 --> 41:08.132
Okay.

41:09.300 --> 41:10.301
Goddamn it!

41:11.427 --> 41:12.470
Damn it.

41:32.615 --> 41:34.116
Hey! Damn it.

42:05.105 --> 42:05.940
You're…

42:09.109 --> 42:09.944
You're…

42:11.529 --> 42:12.655
Against you.

42:19.245 --> 42:20.663
The world's against you.

42:23.040 --> 42:24.375
And you have the right.

42:33.259 --> 42:35.094
Auntie.

42:35.177 --> 42:37.346
Are you all right?

42:37.429 --> 42:38.681
I'm sorry I was late.

42:41.517 --> 42:42.351
I'm sorry.

42:43.060 --> 42:43.894
No, it's okay.

42:49.525 --> 42:50.526
Thanks.

42:52.194 --> 42:53.028
Thanks.

43:15.718 --> 43:16.969
-There you are.
-What?

43:17.052 --> 43:18.345
Why are you up already?

43:18.429 --> 43:20.264
I made breakfast for you. Come sit down.

43:22.850 --> 43:23.767
Seriously?

43:23.851 --> 43:27.062
Sun-jung dropped by the joint
and praised you.

43:27.646 --> 43:29.064
Did her face look okay?

43:29.565 --> 43:32.985
Well, it looked a little swollen,
but I think it's okay.

43:34.695 --> 43:35.904
That's good to hear.

43:35.988 --> 43:37.156
-Try it.
-All right.

43:38.824 --> 43:40.326
I'm not sure how it'll taste.

43:46.832 --> 43:47.666
It's good.

43:47.750 --> 43:49.251
-Does it taste all right?
-Yeah.

43:49.752 --> 43:50.586
Dad.

43:51.670 --> 43:54.757
When you were my age,
what made you happiest?

43:58.677 --> 44:00.554
When I was your age…

44:02.556 --> 44:04.058
acting on stage made me happiest.

44:05.726 --> 44:07.811
Gathering together to rehearse.

44:07.895 --> 44:09.897
Sweating and exchanging lines.

44:09.980 --> 44:11.649
All that hard work.

44:13.651 --> 44:17.946
There's this joy
in seeing my work make others happy.

44:19.365 --> 44:22.826
No matter how much fun you have alone,
nothing beats that joy.

44:25.329 --> 44:28.791
There's this energy you feel

44:29.667 --> 44:32.586
when the passion from your heart
reaches someone else's.

44:33.253 --> 44:34.171
That's my biggest joy.

44:46.266 --> 44:50.688
Two probation officers will be sent
to the task force handling Kang,

44:50.771 --> 44:55.526
and we're approved to budget
for two more martial arts officers.

44:55.609 --> 44:58.612
I asked for extra manpower
to implement the triple-shift rotation,

44:59.196 --> 45:00.155
but it was declined.

45:00.948 --> 45:01.824
I'm sorry.

45:03.450 --> 45:06.954
Fourteen of the fifteen
sexual offenses committed by Kang

45:07.037 --> 45:09.998
occurred immediately before
or after school hours.

45:10.082 --> 45:12.751
The daytime probation officer's role
is crucial.

45:14.461 --> 45:16.171
I'll work the daytime shifts.

45:16.714 --> 45:20.551
But will you be okay with 12-hour shifts?

45:20.634 --> 45:22.010
You have a kid at home.

45:24.888 --> 45:27.015
I'll treat it
like I were protecting my own child.

45:31.687 --> 45:32.563
Hello.

45:33.147 --> 45:34.273
Hello.

45:34.356 --> 45:36.483
Post job openings
for two martial arts officers.

45:36.567 --> 45:37.401
Yes, sir.

45:38.444 --> 45:41.447
-Aren't you on the night shift today?
-Could I have a moment?

45:41.947 --> 45:42.781
Go on ahead.

45:42.865 --> 45:43.866
-Okay.
-Yeah.

45:46.201 --> 45:47.035
Bro.

45:48.370 --> 45:50.080
About this job…

45:50.164 --> 45:51.206
Yeah.

45:52.374 --> 45:53.625
I want more of it.

45:55.294 --> 45:56.628
-Seriously?
-Yes.

46:00.215 --> 46:01.049
Jung-do.

46:02.092 --> 46:03.802
Ten days from now,

46:03.886 --> 46:07.264
I'm moving to the team handling
Kang Ki-jung, a serial sex offender.

46:10.851 --> 46:12.144
Do you want to come with me?

46:13.562 --> 46:17.065
Bro, if you want me,
I'll go anywhere with you!

