01:18:57.691 --> 01:18:59.568
I apologize for not visiting you sooner.

01:18:59.651 --> 01:19:01.278
Please don't worry about it.

01:19:01.361 --> 01:19:06.158
I came to thank you for saving Min-ju.

01:19:10.912 --> 01:19:11.747
Thank you.

01:19:12.831 --> 01:19:13.999
And one more thing.

01:19:16.042 --> 01:19:18.545
Min-ju asked me to give this to you.

01:19:28.764 --> 01:19:31.266
HELLO, UNCLE
I'M MIN-JU, THE GIRL YOU SAVED

01:19:31.349 --> 01:19:33.769
BEFORE YOU SHOWED UP, I WAS REALLY SCARED

01:19:37.230 --> 01:19:39.065
I THOUGHT I'D NEVER SEE MY PARENTS AGAIN

01:19:39.149 --> 01:19:41.026
BUT THANKS TO YOU, I COULD SEE THEM AGAIN

01:19:41.109 --> 01:19:42.778
YOU EVEN GOT HURT SAVING ME
THANK YOU

01:19:43.612 --> 01:19:45.197
Is Min-ju all right?

01:19:48.283 --> 01:19:50.869
She's still too scared to leave the house.

01:19:52.662 --> 01:19:54.623
She says she keeps dreaming about it.

01:19:56.500 --> 01:19:59.920
But when I tell her about you, Mr. Lee,

01:20:01.213 --> 01:20:03.965
she perks up and tries to stay strong.

01:20:06.593 --> 01:20:10.305
Thank you again for saving Min-ju.

01:20:14.518 --> 01:20:17.020
Many believe the punishment
for serial sex offender Kang Ki-jung…

01:20:17.103 --> 01:20:18.188
KANG KI-JUNG ON THE LOOSE

01:20:18.271 --> 01:20:19.439
…was too lenient.

01:20:19.523 --> 01:20:21.691
What's your take, Professor?

01:20:21.775 --> 01:20:24.444
It is true
that our penalties for sex crimes

01:20:24.528 --> 01:20:26.863
are much lighter
than those in other countries.

01:20:26.947 --> 01:20:27.823
Right.

01:20:27.906 --> 01:20:29.741
A few years ago, there were attempts…

01:20:29.825 --> 01:20:30.659
Hey, man.

01:20:31.827 --> 01:20:33.328
-I'm back.
-Have some pizza.

01:20:33.411 --> 01:20:34.538
No, I'm not hungry.

01:20:34.621 --> 01:20:37.457
…concerned it might lead
to excessive punishment.

01:20:38.458 --> 01:20:42.128
We can all agree that sexual assault,
especially sex crimes against children,

01:20:42.212 --> 01:20:46.383
should never be tolerated or forgiven,
regardless of the circumstances.

01:20:46.466 --> 01:20:47.551
Bro.

01:20:47.634 --> 01:20:49.594
You know the girl who was taken by Kang?

01:20:50.387 --> 01:20:52.055
I met her aunt today.

01:20:52.639 --> 01:20:54.808
I heard she was too scared
to leave the house.

01:20:56.643 --> 01:20:58.186
She did nothing wrong.

01:20:58.979 --> 01:21:02.524
Kang Ki-jung raped children
while evading the police

01:21:02.607 --> 01:21:03.733
for over four years.

01:21:06.152 --> 01:21:07.654
He won't get caught easily.

01:21:09.030 --> 01:21:10.240
I know how you feel.

01:21:11.408 --> 01:21:13.535
But you're already injured.

01:21:14.870 --> 01:21:16.329
You can't get hurt again.

01:21:18.456 --> 01:21:19.833
Leave it to the police.

01:21:26.506 --> 01:21:27.340
Hey, guys.

01:21:28.383 --> 01:21:31.011
Shouldn't we try to do what we can?

01:21:31.094 --> 01:21:33.805
I thought the same thing
when I heard that.

01:21:34.514 --> 01:21:35.348
Yeah.

01:21:35.432 --> 01:21:37.309
Even the police can't track him down.

01:21:38.101 --> 01:21:39.519
Can we really help?

01:21:40.103 --> 01:21:41.938
Yes, that's why we should help.

01:21:42.522 --> 01:21:44.524
A lot of criminals
are caught by civilians.

01:21:46.401 --> 01:21:48.403
While tailing Kang, I saw a car,

01:21:48.486 --> 01:21:50.906
but I couldn't see
through the tinted windows.

01:21:50.989 --> 01:21:52.824
It's been bothering me.

01:21:53.491 --> 01:21:54.910
Car make? Plate number?

01:21:56.536 --> 01:21:59.205
A black Range Rover, 100-TA-5525.

01:21:59.289 --> 01:22:00.498
"100-TA-5525."

01:22:00.582 --> 01:22:02.292
All right, I'll ask my bro.

01:22:03.752 --> 01:22:06.880
I'll be out of here next week,
so get me some equipment too.

01:22:06.963 --> 01:22:08.340
Text us a list.

01:22:11.968 --> 01:22:13.845
VEHICLE SEARCH
LICENSE PLATE NUMBER

01:22:15.263 --> 01:22:16.890
-Will this fit Diarrhea?
-Yeah.

01:22:20.477 --> 01:22:21.436
VEHICLE OWNER SEARCH

01:22:21.519 --> 01:22:22.520
KIM MIN-WOOK

01:22:24.564 --> 01:22:27.275
VEHICLE REGISTRATION CERTIFICATE

01:22:35.450 --> 01:22:36.493
That'll be 1.1 million won.

01:22:39.496 --> 01:22:42.040
Plug this in,
and I can control it remotely.

01:22:48.922 --> 01:22:50.173
Guys.

01:22:53.510 --> 01:22:54.511
Oh, it's open.

01:23:09.859 --> 01:23:11.277
FISH SAUCE

01:23:11.361 --> 01:23:12.320
Fish sauce?

01:23:13.154 --> 01:23:14.489
It'll be useful.

01:23:16.157 --> 01:23:16.992
All right.

01:23:19.911 --> 01:23:20.745
Hey!

01:23:21.329 --> 01:23:22.288
Can you open it?

01:23:22.789 --> 01:23:23.957
I saw it on YouTube.

01:23:24.874 --> 01:23:25.875
Good.

01:23:29.879 --> 01:23:31.715
-Hey, what happened?
-Shit.

01:23:33.216 --> 01:23:34.050
I'll try again.

01:23:37.470 --> 01:23:38.763
What? What is this?

01:23:39.639 --> 01:23:41.433
Hey, let's get out of here.

01:23:42.517 --> 01:23:45.103
What's going on? For fuck's sake.

01:24:13.882 --> 01:24:14.924
BRO

01:24:15.008 --> 01:24:15.884
Hey, I got it.

01:24:19.220 --> 01:24:20.138
Yeah, I got it.

01:24:25.727 --> 01:24:27.437
MY LITTLE BRO

01:24:33.485 --> 01:24:34.736
I see a shit ton of files.

01:24:40.867 --> 01:24:43.244
20130924_F_LONG HAIR

01:24:44.120 --> 01:24:46.039
What the fuck is this?

01:24:46.748 --> 01:24:49.626
On this bastard's computer,
there are videos of kids that…

01:24:51.294 --> 01:24:52.128
Guys.

01:24:52.879 --> 01:24:55.632
He has over a terabyte
of child sexual abuse files.

01:24:59.219 --> 01:25:00.053
Give me the Taser.

01:25:00.929 --> 01:25:01.846
-Now!
-Okay.

01:25:04.140 --> 01:25:05.308
Hey, Jung-do.

01:25:08.895 --> 01:25:10.897
Did you get Kang Ki-jung
to film the videos?

01:25:12.607 --> 01:25:13.650
Where is he now?

01:25:15.610 --> 01:25:16.444
Go on. Tase me.

01:25:17.112 --> 01:25:18.113
You don't think I can?

01:25:18.196 --> 01:25:19.030
Do it.

01:25:20.615 --> 01:25:22.367
-Fucking bastard.
-Jung-do! Don't!

01:25:23.118 --> 01:25:23.993
-Let go.
-No.

01:25:24.077 --> 01:25:25.036
-Let go of me!
-Stop.

01:25:25.120 --> 01:25:26.329
Calm down, Jung-do.

01:25:26.913 --> 01:25:27.831
Calm down.

01:25:27.914 --> 01:25:29.499
Let go of me. Let go!

01:25:29.582 --> 01:25:30.750
No, calm down.

01:25:38.341 --> 01:25:39.300
Shut up and relax.

01:25:44.347 --> 01:25:46.516
I can't believe
you actually used it on him.

01:25:46.599 --> 01:25:48.810
I see blood from his eye.
What if he loses his sight?

01:25:49.394 --> 01:25:51.521
Hey, I told you not to do it.

01:25:54.023 --> 01:25:54.941
Hold on.

01:26:00.822 --> 01:26:01.698
Look at your eye.

01:26:04.951 --> 01:26:07.495
If you don't go to the hospital,
you may lose your sight.

01:26:08.955 --> 01:26:12.041
If you tell us where Kang is,
I'll call you an ambulance.

01:26:20.175 --> 01:26:21.384
Nod if you wanna talk.

01:26:29.392 --> 01:26:30.435
Let's sit him up.

01:26:40.862 --> 01:26:41.863
Tell us now.

01:26:42.906 --> 01:26:46.826
I have a debit card linked
to a puppet account.

01:26:46.910 --> 01:26:48.620
Kang's using that card now.

01:26:50.246 --> 01:26:51.206
On my phone,

01:26:51.289 --> 01:26:54.834
you'll see text messages
that tell you where he used the card.

01:26:55.335 --> 01:26:56.794
About an hour ago…

01:26:58.796 --> 01:27:00.048
I received a text.

01:27:00.715 --> 01:27:02.300
You'll find him there.

01:27:02.383 --> 01:27:03.426
CHINESE PAVILION

01:27:03.509 --> 01:27:07.555
I've told you everything,
so please hurry up with the ambulance!

01:27:10.975 --> 01:27:13.561
Has Kang sent you any videos
in the past four weeks?

01:27:20.777 --> 01:27:21.736
He has!

01:27:23.363 --> 01:27:24.197
He has?

01:27:28.034 --> 01:27:30.161
-Hey! Lee Jung-do!
-No, don't do it.

01:27:30.245 --> 01:27:32.121
-No, don't!
-Let go.

01:27:32.205 --> 01:27:33.164
-Don't do it.
-Stop.

01:27:33.248 --> 01:27:34.582
-Don't.
-Hey!

01:27:39.003 --> 01:27:40.630
This is 112. How can I help you?

01:27:40.713 --> 01:27:43.549
There's a man making child pornography.
Please come now.

01:27:43.633 --> 01:27:44.759
Where are you now?

01:27:45.510 --> 01:27:48.513
Kang used Kim's card
at the places marked with red circles

01:27:48.596 --> 01:27:50.807
in the past two weeks.

01:27:50.890 --> 01:27:52.892
Notice all these motels?

01:27:52.976 --> 01:27:55.436
I think it's highly likely
that he's in this area now.

01:27:55.520 --> 01:27:58.189
All right.
Moisture, did you bring your drone?

01:27:58.273 --> 01:27:59.857
Yeah, it's in my car.

01:28:01.150 --> 01:28:03.653
All right, friends. Don't get hurt.

01:28:05.613 --> 01:28:06.447
And

01:28:07.240 --> 01:28:08.283
sorry for yelling.

01:28:10.285 --> 01:28:11.786
That's cool. It's all good.

01:28:12.370 --> 01:28:13.830
Honestly, I was quite shocked.

01:28:15.748 --> 01:28:16.582
Winner winner…

01:28:16.666 --> 01:28:17.959
Chicken dinner!

01:28:19.544 --> 01:28:20.712
God, it's cold.

01:28:25.008 --> 01:28:26.801
-Where are you going?
-What?

01:28:28.469 --> 01:28:30.805
No. Don't do anything dangerous.

01:28:32.473 --> 01:28:33.725
-Dad.
-Hey!

01:28:34.851 --> 01:28:36.019
You were stabbed.

01:28:37.228 --> 01:28:39.397
Any deeper, and you could have died!

01:28:45.653 --> 01:28:47.989
-Guys. Go in for a minute.
-Okay.

01:28:48.072 --> 01:28:49.240
Take your time.

01:28:55.371 --> 01:28:56.539
Three months ago…

01:28:58.583 --> 01:29:00.877
I didn't even know what an ankle tag was.

01:29:04.047 --> 01:29:05.381
But I know everything now.

01:29:05.882 --> 01:29:07.133
In fact, I know too much.

01:29:10.553 --> 01:29:12.263
I cannot forget what I've learned.

01:29:12.347 --> 01:29:13.931
It's the police's job.

01:29:14.766 --> 01:29:16.476
You don't need to get involved.

01:29:18.978 --> 01:29:19.812
You know,

01:29:21.105 --> 01:29:23.274
that young girl I saved that day…

01:29:26.444 --> 01:29:28.613
is still too scared of people
to leave home.

01:29:32.283 --> 01:29:33.159
She's ten.

01:29:34.702 --> 01:29:35.578
Only ten.

01:29:38.915 --> 01:29:42.460
But it hurt the young girl so much
that she shut herself off.

01:29:44.337 --> 01:29:46.172
You know what I found out today?

01:29:48.966 --> 01:29:51.844
That the evil bastard hurt another child.

01:29:56.724 --> 01:29:58.142
The police? Yeah, I know.

01:29:58.893 --> 01:30:00.728
I'm sure they're all working hard.

01:30:01.312 --> 01:30:02.980
I want to do my best too.

01:30:07.360 --> 01:30:08.361
Without regrets.

01:30:11.948 --> 01:30:14.700
I also want to do my best
so I won't have regrets later.

01:30:20.540 --> 01:30:22.250
So please let me just go.

01:30:24.127 --> 01:30:26.045
If I go now, I can catch that bastard.

01:30:28.214 --> 01:30:31.217
As I speak, a ten-year-old girl
could be trembling with fear,

01:30:32.301 --> 01:30:34.554
waiting for me to rescue her, Dad.

01:30:37.265 --> 01:30:38.766
I wouldn't care if I didn't know.

01:30:40.435 --> 01:30:42.520
But now I know. How can I do nothing?

01:30:50.695 --> 01:30:53.030
And I won't get hurt again,
so don't you worry.

01:30:57.702 --> 01:30:59.412
I know I can do it this time, Dad.

01:31:02.206 --> 01:31:03.207
So wish me luck.

01:31:08.296 --> 01:31:09.380
I'll see you later.

01:31:12.091 --> 01:31:13.092
-Let's go.
-Okay.

01:31:19.265 --> 01:31:20.391
Be careful.

01:31:21.767 --> 01:31:22.602
I will!

01:32:11.692 --> 01:32:12.652
Ready.

01:32:16.030 --> 01:32:16.864
VOICE CALL

01:32:19.992 --> 01:32:20.868
Group calling now.

01:32:21.619 --> 01:32:24.622
Tell me immediately if anything happens,
and do not step in.

01:32:24.705 --> 01:32:25.706
Got it?

01:32:26.290 --> 01:32:27.124
Let's go.

01:32:36.842 --> 01:32:39.470
-Earthworm, start here and go straight.
-Okay.

01:32:43.808 --> 01:32:44.767
Hello?

01:32:45.643 --> 01:32:47.019
That way. I'll go this way.

01:32:47.103 --> 01:32:48.271
-Okay, take care.
-Sure.

01:32:52.817 --> 01:32:54.110
-Hello.
-Hello.

01:32:54.193 --> 01:32:57.280
Has this man been staying here?

01:32:57.363 --> 01:32:59.031
No, I haven't seen him.

01:32:59.115 --> 01:33:00.783
Have you seen this man?

01:33:01.492 --> 01:33:02.493
I've never seen him.

01:33:02.577 --> 01:33:04.412
Have you seen this man?

01:33:04.495 --> 01:33:05.830
No, I haven't.

01:33:05.913 --> 01:33:07.373
Please take a closer look.

01:33:07.456 --> 01:33:08.541
I really don't know.

01:33:09.041 --> 01:33:09.875
Thank you.

01:33:09.959 --> 01:33:11.043
He's not staying here.

01:33:11.127 --> 01:33:12.962
Sorry to bother you. Thank you.

01:33:14.505 --> 01:33:17.216
Guys. I'm in front of Daewon Motel now.

01:33:17.300 --> 01:33:19.760
It's at the end of the alley
where we started.

01:33:19.844 --> 01:33:23.472
I see Chinese food containers.
There are a bunch of men's shoes inside.

01:33:23.556 --> 01:33:25.141
-Come check it out.
-Okay.

01:33:28.519 --> 01:33:29.520
Over here.

01:33:32.607 --> 01:33:33.691
-Hey, look.
-Where?

01:33:43.367 --> 01:33:46.454
Hey, did you forget
I saved your life in prison?

01:33:47.038 --> 01:33:48.539
Not this shit again.

01:33:49.123 --> 01:33:50.916
It's about time you let it go.

01:33:52.168 --> 01:33:53.002
Ki-jung.

01:33:53.586 --> 01:33:54.879
Let's open the window.

01:33:59.550 --> 01:34:02.094
I'll handle it from here.
Go wait in the car.

01:34:02.803 --> 01:34:03.638
Be careful.

01:34:04.347 --> 01:34:05.723
-Call us anytime.
-See you.

01:34:05.806 --> 01:34:06.682
See you soon.

01:34:14.523 --> 01:34:15.733
Okay.

01:34:26.619 --> 01:34:28.954
Get out here, Kang Ki-jung,
you son of a bitch!

01:34:32.458 --> 01:34:33.459
What's going on?

01:34:34.293 --> 01:34:36.379
It's dangerous. Please go inside. Sorry.

01:34:36.879 --> 01:34:37.713
Okay.

01:34:42.468 --> 01:34:44.762
Who are you, motherfucker?

01:34:46.597 --> 01:34:48.849
I'll crack your skull open,
you fucking prick.

01:34:50.851 --> 01:34:53.270
Look at that son of a bitch.

01:35:05.991 --> 01:35:08.285
-You fucking bastard.
-Fucking prick!

01:35:09.495 --> 01:35:11.997
This is gochujang! It's burning my eyes!

01:35:12.081 --> 01:35:12.915
Fuck.

01:35:15.543 --> 01:35:17.044
Do you have a death wish?

01:35:27.346 --> 01:35:28.347
My hand!

01:35:31.058 --> 01:35:32.518
Hey, asshole. Come here!

01:35:42.027 --> 01:35:44.155
Hey, you fucking piece of shit!

01:35:50.494 --> 01:35:51.328
What?

01:35:53.372 --> 01:35:54.206
What the hell?

01:36:04.967 --> 01:36:05.801
Moisture!

01:36:05.885 --> 01:36:06.969
I'll follow him.

01:36:14.059 --> 01:36:15.186
You son of a bitch!

01:36:25.654 --> 01:36:27.656
Stop him! Don't let him go inside.

01:36:37.166 --> 01:36:38.000
Son of a…

01:36:46.675 --> 01:36:47.593
It burns!

01:37:01.315 --> 01:37:02.983
You bastard!

01:37:04.735 --> 01:37:06.821
Fuck you, asshole.

01:37:08.405 --> 01:37:09.573
Fuck off, you son of a--

01:37:14.328 --> 01:37:15.746
Moisture, which way?

01:37:15.830 --> 01:37:16.831
Go right.

01:37:21.502 --> 01:37:22.419
Now left.

01:37:24.171 --> 01:37:25.297
Now turn right.

01:37:31.554 --> 01:37:34.223
-He's looking at the drone.
-Maybe he knew all along.

01:37:35.474 --> 01:37:36.392
Damn it.

01:37:42.898 --> 01:37:43.941
You startled me.

01:39:00.142 --> 01:39:01.352
You're dead.

01:39:18.994 --> 01:39:20.037
Come at me.

01:39:21.830 --> 01:39:23.540
Come on out, you bastard.

01:40:14.675 --> 01:40:16.385
Hey, do something.

01:40:32.860 --> 01:40:33.902
-Nice!
-Oh yeah!

01:42:24.388 --> 01:42:26.598
You have the right to remain silent.

01:42:27.641 --> 01:42:29.059
Anything you say can

01:42:30.227 --> 01:42:32.563
and will be used against you
in a court of law.

01:42:34.314 --> 01:42:35.899
SILENT, AGAINST YOU, ATTORNEY

01:42:36.483 --> 01:42:38.569
And you have the right to an attorney.

01:42:54.835 --> 01:42:56.545
"I present this award to you…

01:42:56.628 --> 01:42:57.921
13TH CITIZEN COMMENDATION AWARDS

01:42:58.005 --> 01:43:01.383
…for your outstanding service
and contributions to a better society."

01:43:01.466 --> 01:43:06.346
"January 15, 2024,
President of the Republic of Korea."

01:43:06.930 --> 01:43:08.015
Here.

01:43:08.599 --> 01:43:09.433
Thank you.

01:43:17.816 --> 01:43:19.234
You saved lives.

01:43:20.110 --> 01:43:21.361
Thank you very much.

01:43:22.613 --> 01:43:23.614
Thank you.

01:43:24.239 --> 01:43:28.118
The president will now take pictures
with the award recipients.

01:43:46.803 --> 01:43:47.679
One moment, please.

01:43:49.598 --> 01:43:50.432
Min-ju.

01:43:52.017 --> 01:43:52.851
Min-ju.

01:43:55.062 --> 01:43:55.979
Thank you.

01:43:56.772 --> 01:43:57.606
Are you all right?

01:43:57.689 --> 01:43:59.942
Yes, I'm okay now.

01:44:00.859 --> 01:44:02.236
I'm glad to hear that.

01:44:03.403 --> 01:44:04.279
Thank you.

01:44:13.163 --> 01:44:14.248
Thank you too.

01:44:30.597 --> 01:44:31.723
TRACKING DEVICE DAMAGED

01:44:36.478 --> 01:44:39.064
MARTIAL ARTS OFFICER
LEE JUNG-DO

01:44:56.873 --> 01:45:01.253
OFFICER BLACK BELT

01:47:06.253 --> 01:47:11.258
Subtitle translation by: Sung In Jang
